        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/3bc359/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-01-26T08:06:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm sorry I have to ask this, I am just learning the game. I know this is likely an simple that I am overthinking buuuut, here goes....I&nbsp;am trying to set up SFLF and the card says; \" Put 3 Presence on your starting board. 2 in the highest numbered jungle and 1 in Land #5\"</p>\n<p>What and where is \"Land #5\" ?</p>\n<p>Does it mean any&nbsp;space on the island with a #5 on it ?</p>\n<p>Thanks in advance for your help</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:23.813Z",
