        "raw": "<p>Each space on the island is called a land. The lands on each island board are numbered (1-8 on the standard side). The initial presence placement rules are typically based on terrain, but often care about other things, such as the land number (as in this case) or the presence of Dahan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>An example: if you are setting up Shadows on board A, you would place two presence in land number 8 (the highest-numbered jungle) and one presence in land number 5 (a wetland in this case, but that isn't relevant). In a multi-spirit game, all initlial presence you place is on your starting board only, unless otherwise specified (currently only Sharp Fangs, from the Branch and Claw expansion).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Does this help?</p>",
